  "job_B14.51_20251003_114318": {
    "chunk_text": "Be gri\u00f0e & be munde: Godes gri\u00f0 is ealra gri\u00f0a selast to geearnianne & geornost to healdanne & \u00fe\u00e6r \u00d0onne is rihtlic, \u00fe\u00e6t Godes cyricgri\u00f0 binnan wagum & Cristenes cyninges handgri\u00f0 stande efen & hwilum w\u00e6ran heafodstedas & healice hadas micelre m\u00e6\u00f0e & munde wyr\u00f0e & gri\u00f0ian mihton \u00fea, \u00fee & \u00feus hit stod on \u00f0am dagum inne mid Englum, \u00f0\u00e6t, gyf feorhscyldig man cyning gesohte, arcebiscop & gyf he gesohte leodbiscop o\u00f0\u00f0e ealdorman o\u00f0\u00f0on healicne heafodstede, \u00feonne ahte he VII nihta gri\u00f0, & on Cantwara lage cyning & arcebiscop agan gelicne and efen dyrne mundbryce. & on \u00feam lagum is arcebiscopes feoh endlyfangylde & cynges is nigongylde. & Christes cyrican mundbyrd is efne swa cynges. & on Su\u00f0engla lage gri\u00f0lagu \u00feus stent, \u00f0\u00e6t, gif hwa gefeohte\u00f0 on cyrican o\u00f0\u00f0on on cynges huse, \u00feonne & gif hwa gefeohte\u00f0 on mynstre butan cyrcean, gebete eall mid fulre bote \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6rto gebyrige be & gyf hwa cynges mundbrice elles gewyrce, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t mid V pundum on Engla lage, arcebiscopes & & gyf man beforan \u00e6\u00f0elinge o\u00f0\u00f0e arcebiscpe gefeoht agynne\u00f0, mid CL scillinga gebete; gyf beforan & on Nor\u00f0engla lage stent, \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00f0e ofsleh\u00f0 man binnan cyricwagum, he bi\u00f0 feorhscyldig. & se \u00f0e gewunda\u00f0,",
